    "created_at": "2022-05-19T23:33:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-05-19T23:33:42Z",
    "body": "Nice. I value aligning with MDN and I don't have any strong preference for httpwg vs. rfc-editor. So I'd push to make that semi-official WHATWG policy, starting with HTML and hopefully upstreaming to Bikeshed/Specref at some point.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
