    "updated_at": "2022-05-23T17:56:56Z",
    "body": "I found at least some cases where httpwg has good formatting and rfc-editor does not: https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7231 vs. https://httpwg.org/specs/rfc7231.html . So the MDN order is definitely better than my proposal from that perspective.",
